Package: mathr
Version: 0.1.5
Title: Scientific Computation Using R
Description: A collection of undergraduate level mathematical routines for
    quantitative work, covering calculus, distribution functions, random
    variate generation, linear algebra, differential equations and
    optimization, sized for one semester. The package is best studied with
    its source open: every routine is short and written to be read.
Depends: R (>= 3.0.0)
